{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox chaos, backyard inventions, and revenge on Baldy - time to take action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stan's garage has been taken over by Baldy's dirty tricks. Now, as Rafa, it's up to you to help your buddy take back what's rightfully his! But remember - a plan? Well... let's just say pure improvisation, absurdity, and total mayhem rule here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, sabotage, and build your own backyard inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify cars, test ridiculous ideas, and hustle your way to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break stuff, mess around, and create chaos wherever and however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the wildest revenge plan ever seen - but beware: every action can have unpredictable consequences!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stan's Workshop\u00a0</strong>is a sandbox adventure full of humor, freedom, and absurd situations where every player writes their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the craziest garage showdown ever!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567980?t=1773324669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3567980?t=1773324669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567980/e3dc5996fb4f8d8607bb1cbc3e6a0467b107f628/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773324669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567980/e3dc5996fb4f8d8607bb1cbc3e6a0467b107f628/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773324669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox chaos, backyard inventions, and revenge on Baldy - time to take action!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stan's garage has been taken over by Baldy's dirty tricks. Now, as Rafa, it's up to you to help your buddy take back what's rightfully his! But remember - a plan? Well... let's just say pure improvisation, absurdity, and total mayhem rule here.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tinker, sabotage, and build your own backyard inventions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify cars, test ridiculous ideas, and hustle your way to the top.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break stuff, mess around, and create chaos wherever and however you want.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry out the wildest revenge plan ever seen - but beware: every action can have unpredictable consequences!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stan's Workshop\u00a0</strong>is a sandbox adventure full of humor, freedom, and absurd situations where every player writes their own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Add it to your wishlist and get ready for the craziest garage showdown ever!</strong></p>","developers":["Marcin Kaczmarek"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567980/12839f936a7d4800683a4d45dd794053e4e01ce6/header.jpg?t=1773324669","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3567980/348767006/753c1ad3ba8f77b89b881b87bbb49383dfa48a27/1770547860/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770549928","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3567980/348767006/753c1ad3ba8f77b89b881b87bbb49383dfa48a27/1770547860/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770549928","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3567980/348767006/753c1ad3ba8f77b89b881b87bbb49383dfa